// File: .cursor/rules/mdc-rule-location.mdc
/*
MDC Rule: MDC Rule File Location

- All new MDC rules must be created in the ".cursor/rules" directory.
- Each MDC rule must be stored as a separate file within this directory.
- Do not combine multiple rules into a single file.
- File names should be descriptive of the rule's purpose and use lowercase with hyphens (e.g., "my-feature-rule.mdc").
- This ensures modularity, clarity, and ease of management for all MDC rules in the project.
*/
